---
import SubLayout from '../layouts/SubLayout.astro';
---

<SubLayout title="FIRMWARE" section="FIRMWARE"
  classification="CLASSIFICATION: BUILD INSTRUCTIONS / STACK: C / UFBT"
  introLines={[
    "These instructions assume you have what you need.",
    "If you do not —",
    "that is a different problem.",
  ]}
  introAction="[ INITIALIZE ]">

  <div class="scene-divider" style="margin-top:0;">
    <p><span class="tag tag--active">LIVE</span> Set a node's behavior from the browser, over USB —
    no install, nothing on the air: <a href="/config"><strong>[ CONFIGURATOR ]</strong></a></p>
  </div>

  <h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2>
  <p>Python 3.8+, pip, and a Flipper Zero running official or compatible firmware.
  On the Heltec, enable the Meshtastic Serial module in PROTO mode (RX GPIO7, TX GPIO6,
  115200, override-console off) — that is the link GhostMesh speaks over.</p>

  <h2>INSTALL BUILD TOOL</h2>
  <div class="code-block"><pre>pip install ufbt
ufbt --version</pre></div>

  <h2>BUILD</h2>
  <div class="code-block"><pre>git clone https://github.com/ComplacencyKillz/GhostMesh.git
cd GhostMesh/flipper-app
ufbt</pre></div>
  <p>First run downloads the SDK (~1 min). Output: <code style="color:var(--blue);">dist/ghostmesh.fap</code></p>

  <h2>DEPLOY</h2>
  <p><span class="tag tag--active">USB</span> With Flipper connected, qFlipper closed:</p>
  <div class="code-block"><pre>ufbt launch</pre></div>
  <p><span class="tag">MANUAL</span> Copy <code style="color:var(--blue);">dist/ghostmesh.fap</code>
  to <code style="color:var(--blue);">SD:/apps/Tools/</code> via qFlipper or SD card reader.</p>

  <h2>RUN</h2>
  <p><strong>Apps → Tools → GhostMesh</strong></p>
  <p>Title bar shows <code style="color:var(--text-dim);">...</code> during handshake
  (~3 seconds), then <code style="color:var(--terminal);">RDY</code> when connected.
  Select a profile, navigate messages, press OK to send.</p>

  <h2>CUSTOM PROFILES</h2>
  <p>Create <code style="color:var(--blue);">SD:/apps_data/ghostmesh/profiles.yaml</code>:</p>
  <div class="code-block"><pre>name: My Profile
- CHECKIN OK
- IN POSITION
- ABORT
- EXFIL NOW

name: Grid Down Custom
- NEED ASSISTANCE
- MOVING
- SHELTER IN PLACE</pre></div>
  <p>Up to 5 custom profiles alongside 3 built-ins. Max 12 messages per profile,
  22 characters per message, printable ASCII only.</p>

  <h2>MESHTASTIC SETUP</h2>
  <p>Flash at <a href="https://flasher.meshtastic.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">flasher.meshtastic.org</a>.
  Select <strong>Heltec WiFi LoRa 32 V3</strong>, set your region. For operational use,
  generate a private channel — the default channel uses a public key visible to every
  Meshtastic node worldwide.</p>

  <div class="scene-divider">
    <p>Full build guide →
      <a href="https://github.com/ComplacencyKillz/GhostMesh/blob/main/docs/flipper-setup.md"
         target="_blank" rel="noopener">docs/flipper-setup.md</a>
    </p>
  </div>

</SubLayout>
